{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09521","headline":"绵州越王楼即事 · 乔琳","name":"绵州越王楼即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三蜀澄清郡政闲，登楼携酌日跻攀。\n顿觉胷怀无俗事，回看掌握是人寰。\n滩声曲折涪州水，云影低衔富乐山。\n行雁南飞似乡信，忽然西笑向秦关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔琳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}